nce-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Flint</h2><small>Genesee County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/dearborn-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/city-dearborn.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/city-dearborn-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/city-dearborn.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Dearborn</h2><small>Wayne County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/troy-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Troy</h2><small>Oakland County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/sterling-heights-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/winter-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/winter-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/winter-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="908" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Sterling Heights</h2><small>Macomb County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/kalamazoo-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Kalamazoo</h2><small>Kalamazoo County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/saginaw-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Saginaw</h2><small>Saginaw County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/traverse-city-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/city-traverse-city.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/city-traverse-city-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/city-traverse-city.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="933" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Traverse City</h2><small>Grand Traverse County</small></span></a><a class="city rv" href="/mi-cities-served/marquette-insurance-appraiser/"><img class="city-img" src="/assets/img/photos/city-marquette.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/city-marquette-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/city-marquette.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 50vw, (max-width:1100px) 33vw, 25vw" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="city-b"><h2 class="city-h">Marquette</h2><small>Marquette County</small></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-ice"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><p class="eyebrow">Regions</p><h2>How claims change from region to region</h2><p>Michigan’s 83 counties span two peninsulas joined by the Mackinac Bridge. Snow belts, river valleys and dense older suburbs each shape the claims we see.</p></div><div class="scards" data-stagger><div class="scard rv"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/detroit-skyline.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/detroit-skyline-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/detroit-skyline.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="700" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><p class="eyebrow">Wayne · Oakland · Macomb</p><h3>Metro Detroit</h3><p>Brick bungalows in Detroit and Dearborn, postwar ranches in Warren and Sterling Heights, and big colonials in Troy all share one weakness: basements. The August 2014 and June 2021 floods filled thousands of them, and the February 2023 ice storm dropped limbs across the region.</p></span></div><div class="scard rv"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/city-grand-rapids.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/city-grand-rapids-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/city-grand-rapids.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><p class="eyebrow">Kent · Ottawa · Kalamazoo</p><h3>West Michigan</h3><p>From Grand Rapids to the lakeshore, snow belt winters load roofs and build ice dams, and spring storms track in off Lake Michigan. The 1956 Hudsonville–Standale tornado, the 1980 Kalamazoo tornado and the 2024 Portage tornado frame the risk.</p></span></div><div class="scard rv"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lansing-capitol.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lansing-capitol-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lansing-capitol.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="979" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><p class="eyebrow">Ingham · Genesee · Saginaw</p><h3>Mid-Michigan &amp; the Bay</h3><p>Lansing still remembers the December 2013 ice storm, Flint the 1953 Flint–Beecher tornado, and the Great Lakes Bay region the 2020 Edenville and Sanford dam failures. Housing ranges from early-1900s neighborhoods to newer suburbs.</p></span></div><div class="scard rv"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/city-traverse-city.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/city-traverse-city-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/city-traverse-city.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="933" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><p class="eyebrow">Grand Traverse · Otsego · Emmet</p><h3>Northern Michigan</h3><p>Cottages, condos and year-round homes around Traverse City and Gaylord face heavy snow and long freezes, and the May 2022 Gaylord tornado showed how quickly a summer storm can hit up north. Vacancy and heat conditions matter for seasonal homes.</p></span></div><div class="scard rv"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/city-marquette.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/city-marquette-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/city-marquette.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><p class="eyebrow">Marquette · Houghton · Chippewa</p><h3>Upper Peninsula</h3><p>The U.P. measures snow in feet, not inches. Older wood-frame homes, camps and commercial buildings along Lake Superior see roof collapse risk, ice dams and gales that rival the November storms of Great Lakes history.</p></span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your city?</h2><p>We cover all 83 counties. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-maize" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="/request-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
